    "summary": "Lists tickets for the service provider using cursor pagination. Default sort is `updatedOn desc`. sortBy accepts only `updatedOn` or `createdOn`; sortOrder accepts only `asc` or `desc` (case-insensitive) — any other value is rejected with a 400.",
